+Thermoregulators retain temperature control and nearby artificial crop climates, but have no Climatologist workstation states and are removed from acquirable job sites. The guide explains matching crop climates and heating/cooling fuel rather than the removed workstation role. Artificial crop climates require an enabled machine with at least one active fuel mode. Heating or cooling also supports neutral crops; both modes together support neutral crops only. Stored fuel must activate a mode before it provides crop support.
